# condor_submit_dag supergranulation.dag :
#   1. one job per day of supergranulation_days.txt: HMI epochs and 45 s dopplergrams of its exposures (supergranulation_day.sub)
#   2. all the days: calibration, simulations, statistics and figures (supergranulation_collect.sub; it runs even if
#      some days failed: only the complete days are used)
JOB days    supergranulation_day.sub
JOB collect supergranulation_collect.sub
PARENT days CHILD collect
SCRIPT POST days /bin/true
